# Running Python

This project uses [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) for dependency and environment management. Source code lives under `src/` (package: `elephant_id`).

Always `cd` into the project root and run via `uv` so the correct environment and dependencies are used. Do not manually activate `.venv` or call `python` directly.

```bash
cd /path/to/elephant-id
uv run python path/to/script.py
# or run a module from the src/ package:
uv run python -m elephant_id.module
# tests:
uv run pytest
```

To sync dependencies (including dev and optional groups as needed):

```bash
uv sync
# with extras:
uv sync --extra visualization --extra roboflow
```
